* Library of Vishay MLV SMD varistors
*
*
* $Revision:   2.0  $
* $Author:   Alain Stas  $
* $Date:   26 Aug 2015 $
* $Revision History : 
*---------------------------------------------------------------
*
* Vishay NTC Thermistors included in this file : MLV
* DESCRIPTION: through hole and surface mount NTC thermistors
* For power rating and temperature range limitations, see 
* MLV0402E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29107/
* MLV0603E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29108/
* MLV0805E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29109/
* MLV1206E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29126/
* MLV1210E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29127/
* MLV1812E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29128/
* MLV2220E3 :http://www.vishay.com/varistors/list/product-29129/ 
* or use the search engine of Vishay for visualizing particular data sheet at http://www.vishay.com/
*
* the model is applicable for transient and steady states AC and DC .
* 
*
*
*
*$
.SUBCKT MLV_BASE_MODEL 1 2  PARAMs:  B1=1 B2=1 B3=1 B4=1  L=1h C=1pf  T=1
C_C1         2 4  {C}  TC=0,0 
V_V1         4 5 0Vdc   
E_E1         5 2 VALUE { T*(
+ PWR(10,
+  B1+B2*(LOG10(LIMIT(V(6),1m,100G))-4)+B3*EXP(-LOG10(LIMIT(V(6),1m,100G))+4)+B4*EXP(LOG10(LIMIT(V(6),1m,100G))-4)
+ )
+ -PWR(10,
+  B1+B2*(LOG10(-LIMIT(V(6),-100G,-1m))-4)+B3*EXP(-LOG10(-LIMIT(V(6),-100G,-1m))+4)+B4*EXP(LOG10(-LIMIT(V(6),-100G,-1m))-4)
+ )
+ +LIMIT((V(6)*1K*V(7)),-V(7),V(7))
+ ) }
E_E2         6 0 VALUE { +(I(V_V1))*10K }
R_R1         3 1  100u TC=0,0 
L_L1         4 3  {L}  
R_R3         0 6  1T TC=0,0 
R_R4         0 7  1T TC=0,0 
E_E3         7 0 VALUE { PWR(10,(B1+B2*(-7)+B3*EXP(+7)+B4*EXP(-7))) }
.ENDS
*$
